ime Maitreyarakṣita, Kāśyapa and\nthe Puruṣakāra. He is often quoted in the Mādha-\nvīyadhātuvṛtti.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Tilakamañjarī. Quoted by Nami on Kāvyālaṃkāra\n16, 3.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "धनपाल son of Sarvadeva, brother of Śobhana, a Jaina:\nPāiyalacchi Nāmamālā, a Prākṛt vocabulary,\nwritten in 972--973. BA. 20. Bl. 16. Bühler\nin Bezzenberger's Beiträge IV, 70. As a lexi-\ncographer he is quoted by Hemacandra Oxf.\n185^b, by Bhānujī Oxf. 182^b.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धनपालः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DanapAlaH"]}], "Danaraja": [{"id": "DanarAja", "headword": "धनराज", "headword_slp1": "DanarAja", "fold": "Danaraja", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "Mahādevīdīpikā jy. B. 4, 172. P. 14. See Sāraṇī.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "धनराज son of Vidyāvinoda:\n Jātakārṇavaṭīkā.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "DanavarmanupaDyaya": [{"id": "DanavarmanupADyAya", "headword": "धनवर्मनुपाध्याय", "headword_slp1": "DanavarmanupADyAya", "fold": "DanavarmanupaDyaya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "धनवर्मन् उपाध्याय poet. Sbhv.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "DanaviBagaviveka": [{"id": "DanaviBAgaviveka", "headword": "धनविभागविवेक", "headword_slp1": "DanaviBAgaviveka", "fold": "DanaviBagaviveka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "धनविभागविवेक See Bhāgaviveka.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "भागविवेक or धनविभागविवेक on inheritance, by Rāma\nBhaṭṭa, son of Śrīnātha, with his own C.. IO. 2047 A.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Danasara": [{"id": "DanasAra", "headword": "धनसार", "headword_slp1": "DanasAra", "fold": "Danasara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "धनसार, a pupil of Siddhasūri:\n C. on Bhartṛhari's Śataka.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Danika": [{"id": "Danika", "headword":